":"■クレジット","body":[{"intro":"イラスト…RYO様<br />\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/RYO_B\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/RYO_B</a><br />\n<br />\n声優・デザイン・編集・企画…えもこ<br />\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/emoco_asmr\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/emoco_asmr</a>"}]}],"description":"友達以上恋人未満の関係を壊し合う…。田舎に住むあなたと幼馴染のちはやの、夏より熱い恋の物語。","short_introduction":"友達以上恋人未満の関係を壊し合う…。田舎に住むあなたと幼馴染のちはやの、夏より熱い恋の物語。","options":["SND","DLP","REV","OLY","ORW"],"url":"https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ406537.html","site_id":"maniax","fetched_at":1795528431}